-- | background | wait/io/file/sql/pid                 |     3 | 266.30 us | 185.47 us   |
-- | background | wait/io/file/sql/casetest            |     5 | 246.81 us | 150.19 us   |
-- | background | wait/io/file/sql/global_ddl_log      |     2 | 21.24 us  | 18.59 us    |
